3743525042,"text":"#Ah, it's you, {NICKNAME}.","nextNodeIds":[745270402,745270403]},{"nodeId":745270402,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2382253882,"text":"It's been a while, Escoffier.","nextNodeIds":[745270404]},{"nodeId":745270404,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30915,"speakerName":"Escoffier","textMapHash":3225142850,"text":"I'm not heading up the kitchen today. I'm here as a taste-tester.","nextNodeIds":[745270405]},{"nodeId":745270405,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30915,"speakerName":"Escoffier","textMapHash":921965818,"text":"Savanna's trying to come up with something new, and has asked me to check on her. That said, this is... the fifth take on the same dish so far.","nextNodeIds":[745270406]},{"nodeId":745270406,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30915,"speakerName":"Escoffier","textMapHash":2703417330,"text":"If it's not the texture of the ingredients being affected by a few seconds' disparity in temperature control, then it's the aroma of the spices used dominating due to over-seasoning.","nextNodeIds":[745270407]},{"nodeId":745270407,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":270580554,"text":"You're as exacting as ever, I see.","nextNodeIds":[745270408]},{"nodeId":745270408,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30915,"speakerName":"Escoffier","textMapHash":1115523570,"text":"Of course! Cooking is a science, and our friendship isn't going to change that. In fact, our friendship and our duty to our customers demand that I be strict.","nextNodeIds":[745270409,745270410]},{"nodeId":745270409,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":230338154,"text":"I do actually have a small request...","nextNodeIds":[745270411]},{"nodeId":745270411,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30915,"speakerName":"Escoffier","textMapHash":2320831506,"text":"...At a time like this? If the pictures are going up for public display, might I suggest finding another moment?","nextNodeIds":[745270412]},{"nodeId":745270412,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30915,"speakerName":"Escoffier","textMapHash":1713036458,"text":"We need to put the set together with care, and carefully adjust the lighting and angle for the best possible results...","nextNodeIds":[745270413,745270414]},{"nodeId":745270413,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":4000539418,"text":"I'm just taking a commemorative photo.","nextNodeIds":[745270415]},{"nodeId":745270415,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30915,"speakerName":"Escoffier","textMapHash":2571073354,"text":"...Alright. There's a bit of time before the sixth redo, anyway.","nextNodeIds":[745270416]},{"nodeId":745270416,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30915,"speakerName":"Escoffier","textMapHash":2682405666,"text":"In that case, let's see whether your lens or that new dish will come out on top.","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":745270414,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1608296650,"text":"I'm also looking to test out this new lens.","nextNodeIds":[745270415]},{"nodeId":745270410,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3522030362,"text":"Would you mind if I took a picture of you, then?","nextNodeIds":[745270411]},{"nodeId":745270403,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":194876266,"text":"Are you cooking up an all-new recipe?","nextNodeIds":[745270404]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":1,"LNHLPKELCAL":[0,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_LUA_NOTIFY","PPFLKMOMKAI":"7452701"}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_ST